# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

~> **Note:** This resource is behind a feature flag. Set the environment variable `YBM_FF_AMP=true` to use it.

Creating the environment registers it and returns `agent_api_key` and `install_hint`. The environment stays `PENDING` until you install its agent with them. `agent_api_key` is only returned by the apply that registers the environment.

!> **Warning:** Destroying the environment deregisters it and revokes the agent API key, but its name stays claimed, so an environment with the same name cannot be registered again.

